   "cooked": "<div class=\"onebox lazyYT lazyYT-container\" data-parameters=\"feature=oembed&amp;wmode=opaque&amp;start=39\" data-youtube-id=\"WJ23oQpooG0\" data-youtube-title=\"EthCC 2: Griff Green\">\n<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WJ23oQpooG0\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">\n<img class=\"ytp-thumbnail-image\" height=\"388\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/original/1X/744a9745038a7d7a3329f8662f33082dca97fd1f.jpeg\" title=\"EthCC 2: Griff Green\" width=\"690\"/>\n</a>\n</div>\n<p>The first ~10 minutes I talk about the necessary infrastructure needed for Decentralized Governance to really scale, but the last 1/2 I dig into the dream of building a Commons that can scale to provide the the public good to the entire world <img alt=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/smiley.png?v=9\" title=\":smiley:\"/></p>",
