   "cooked": "<p>In March 2019:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Aragon Fundraising (Aragon Black’s bonding curve implementation) was still in <a href=\"https://github.com/AragonBlack/fundraising/commit/a6a8ec06fd5521cbb3aef3ac353dfb19956fbd30\">early development</a>\n</li>\n<li>Conviction Voting was just an idea that was <a href=\"https://devpost.com/software/gitviction\">implemented for the first time</a> in the hackathon after EthCC 2.</li>\n<li>Fees were so low in mainnet that Aragon would not be deployed on xDAI until 2020.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>But…</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox twitterstatus\">\n<header class=\"source\">\n<a href=\"https://twitter.com/elonmusk/status/1355068728128516101\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">twitter.com</a>\n</header>\n<article class=\"onebox-body\">\n<img class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" height=\"400\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/uploads/default/original/1X/5216f6333cd28c4d684ea46432d63242fd76f83b.jpeg\" width=\"400\"/>\n<h4><a href=\"https://twitter.com/elonmusk/status/1355068728128516101\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Elon Musk (elonmusk)</a></h4>\n<div class=\"tweet\"> In retrospect, it was inevitable</div>\n<div class=\"date\">\n<a href=\"https://twitter.com/elonmusk/status/1355068728128516101\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">00:22 - 29. Jan. 2021</a>\n<span class=\"like\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"16px\" viewbox=\"0 0 512 512\" width=\"14px\">\n<path d=\"M462.3 62.6C407.5 15.9 326 24.3 275.7 76.2L256 96.5l-19.7-20.3C186.1 24.3 104.5 15.9 49.7 62.6c-62.8 53.6-66.1 149.8-9.9 207.9l193.5 199.8c12.5 12.9 32.8 12.9 45.3 0l193.5-199.8c56.3-58.1 53-154.3-9.8-207.9z\"></path>\n</svg> 615.000\n    </span>\n<span class=\"retweet\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"16px\" viewbox=\"0 0 640 512\" width=\"14px\">\n<path d=\"M629.657 343.598L528.971 444.284c-9.373 9.372-24.568 9.372-33.941 0L394.343 343.598c-9.373-9.373-9.373-24.569 0-33.941l10.823-10.823c9.562-9.562 25.133-9.34 34.419.492L480 342.118V160H292.451a24.005 24.005 0 0 